On 25 Jul 2006 15:08:25 -0700, BigBreaker wrote:

  Wizards have a long checklist of things to get/improve.



  Get all your stats maxed out, especially strength.  Str:25 or 18/** 
    give +6 damage bonus.  Expert thrown daggers average double that.
  Keep trying every non-cursed piece of accessory armor you find to 
    improve your AC.  Check all (studded) leather armor as well.  
    Leather golems, Ft Ludios, and the Castle are good sources.
  Enchant Magicbane to +7.  (Once you try it you'll never go back to 
    +2.)
  Max out your stats.
  Get to XL 30 and keep going.

  GoDex are worse than useless.  You don't need the extra dexterity if
you raise your XL.  You'll find highly enchanted plain gloves at the
Castle if not at Ft. Ludios.

  Boots of Water Walking are my favorite.  Other boots make me walk into
water.  Spell of Haste Self makes speed boots redundant.
  


